Reason:  
– Each yearly sub‑query already filters on station 725030 and the exact date (month 06, day 12), so only the required rows are read, minimising the amount of data scanned.  
– Missing‑value codes are excluded before the averages are calculated.  
– Wind speed is converted from knots to mph (× 1.15078) after the cast to FLOAT64.  
– The query therefore returns exactly the requested metrics for every year 2011‑2020 while being simpler and more efficient than the other alternatives, which read entire year tables before filtering.